e file into a title and content.\\\\n            4.  Generates a unique `articleID` (UUID) and a `creationDate` timestamp.\\\\n            5.  Uses the DynamoDB SDK to save the structured data as a new item in the news table.\\\\n        *   **IAM Role Permissions:** The function's role requires `s3:GetObject` on the uploads bucket and `dynamodb:PutItem` on the news table, plus logging permissions.\\\\n\\\\n3.  **DynamoDB News Table (`HOA_News_Articles`):\\\\n    *   **Purpose:** To durably store and serve news articles to the frontend.\\\\n    *   **Schema:**\\\\n        *   **Partition Key:** `articleID` (String) - A unique UUID.\\\\n        *   **Attributes:**\\\\n            *   `title` (String)\\\\n            *   `content` (String)\\\\n            *   `creationDate` (String) - An ISO 8601 timestamp for chronological sorting.\\\\n\\\\nThis comprehensive plan provides a secure, scalable, and cost-effective serverless solution that meets all specified requirements. The components are designed to be deployed deterministically during the Execution phase. I await your review and further instructions.\\\\n\\\\nEnd of report.\\\"\\n}\\n###report-to-yularen-1###\"}]},\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"custom\":{}}],\"custom\":{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"My subordinates have delivered their plans promptly and with excellent detail. I have reviewed both reports and will now synthesize them into a single, comprehensive plan to fulfill my orders from Director Yularen.\\n\\nThis consolidated report addresses all requirements for the serverless business logic, covering both the contact form and the code-free news update system.\\n\\n###report-to-yularen-1###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: REPORT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"originalOrderSequenceID\\\": \\\"YULAREN-MOTTI-1\\\",\\n  \\\"reportString\\\": \\\"To Director Yularen,\\\\n\\\\nIn response to your order (YULAREN-MOTTI-1), I have completed the planning for the serverless business logic for the HOA website. My Attendants h